  // Models: Quaternius Stylized Nature MegaKit (free, CC0), assets/nature/. "wind" (metres of sway at the top) switches
  // them to foliage.gdshader ("stiffness" keeps tree trunks still). "bakedShadow" casts a soft shadow baked into the
  // ground instead of a realtime one.
  //
  // Distance: instances thin out between thin[0] and thin[1] (measured shorter when looking down) down to thinMin, the
  // survivors growing by "compensate" so the ground stays covered; the last ones fade out just before "range".
  // Ground cover that should come in as the camera gets close (short grass, clover) thins to 0 over a short range;
  // things that must read from the board camera (tall grass, flower beds, trees) keep a share far out.
  // Clumps ("procedural:grass" / "procedural:flowers") also drop single blades between bladeThin[0] and [1], down to
  // bladeMin, then swap to a light mesh with just those blades.
